"id": 401638887, "tag_name": "rust-v0.162.0-alpha.5", "name": "0.162.0-alpha.5", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-10-02T07:13:13Z", "published_at": "2026-10-02T08:11:11Z", "body": "Release 0.162.0-alpha.5\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.162.0-alpha.4", "id": 401567999, "tag_name": "rust-v0.162.0-alpha.4", "name": "0.162.0-alpha.4", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-10-02T04:46:54Z", "published_at": "2026-10-02T05:44:28Z", "body": "Release 0.162.0-alpha.4\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.162.0-alpha.3", "id": 401522823, "tag_name": "rust-v0.162.0-alpha.3", "name": "0.162.0-alpha.3", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-10-02T02:46:22Z", "published_at": "2026-10-02T03:38:25Z", "body": "Release 0.162.0-alpha.3\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.162.0-alpha.2", "id": 401480968, "tag_name": "rust-v0.162.0-alpha.2", "name": "0.162.0-alpha.2", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-10-02T00:51:47Z", "published_at": "2026-10-02T01:44:23Z", "body": "Release 0.162.0-alpha.2\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.160.0", "id": 401312540, "tag_name": "rust-v0.160.0", "name": "0.160.0", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-10-01T17:13:38Z", "published_at": "2026-10-01T20:19:13Z", "body": "## New Features\n\n- Browse older tasks in the agent command center with a keyboard-accessible “Show more” action. (#49106)\n- Select transcript text and paste with middle-click in fullscreen mode on supported local Linux X11 terminals. (#49112)\n- Start sessions outside a project with workspace defaults when policy permits, and restore saved permissions when resuming. (#49160)\n- Added opt-in Guardian review capabilities to retrieve earlier user instructions and include context from agent handoffs. (#49036, #49057)\n\n## Bug Fixes\n\n- Unsent queued messages now resume after reconnection once uncertain submissions are resolved, avoiding duplicate sends. (#49105)\n- The terminal UI now preserves server provider, reasoning-summary, and verbosity settings and shows the correct sessions in resume and fork history. (#49144, #49161, #49171)\n- Fixed Windows sandbox PowerShell fallbacks and long-path permission repairs, and suppressed unwanted console windows from background helpers. (#49019, #49058, #49098, #49164, #49386)\n- Subagents now retain environments that are still starting and receive their configuration or preparation failure. (#49075)\n- Prevented SQLite stalls during connection setup an"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.162.0-alpha.1", "id": 401416345, "tag_name": "rust-v0.162.0-alpha.1", "name": "0.162.0-alpha.1", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-10-01T20:48:32Z", "published_at": "2026-10-01T22:57:00Z", "body": "Release 0.162.0-alpha.1\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.161.0-alpha.9", "id": 400778004, "tag_name": "rust-v0.161.0-alpha.9", "name": "0.161.0-alpha.9", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-10-01T07:21:00Z", "published_at": "2026-10-01T08:35:22Z", "body": "Release 0.161.0-alpha.9\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.161.0-alpha.8", "id": 400698028, "tag_name": "rust-v0.161.0-alpha.8", "name": "0.161.0-alpha.8", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-10-01T04:44:25Z", "published_at": "2026-10-01T06:24:10Z", "body": "Release 0.161.0-alpha.8\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.161.0-alpha.7", "id": 400636696, "tag_name": "rust-v0.161.0-alpha.7", "name": "0.161.0-alpha.7", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-10-01T02:54:03Z", "published_at": "2026-10-01T03:54:35Z", "body": "Release 0.161.0-alpha.7\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.161.0-alpha.6", "id": 400602811, "tag_name": "rust-v0.161.0-alpha.6", "name": "0.161.0-alpha.6", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-10-01T01:32:41Z", "published_at": "2026-10-01T02:34:10Z", "body": "Release 0.161.0-alpha.6\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.161.0-alpha.13", "id": 401156642, "tag_name": "rust-v0.161.0-alpha.13", "name": "0.161.0-alpha.13", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-10-01T15:34:49Z", "published_at": "2026-10-01T16:35:03Z", "body": "Release 0.161.0-alpha.13\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.161.0-alpha.12", "id": 401063591, "tag_name": "rust-v0.161.0-alpha.12", "name": "0.161.0-alpha.12", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-10-01T13:14:19Z", "published_at": "2026-10-01T14:43:50Z", "body": "Release 0.161.0-alpha.12\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.161.0-alpha.11", "id": 400940186, "tag_name": "rust-v0.161.0-alpha.11", "name": "0.161.0-alpha.11", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-10-01T11:26:12Z", "published_at": "2026-10-01T12:20:46Z", "body": "Release 0.161.0-alpha.11\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.161.0-alpha.10", "id": 400858796, "tag_name": "rust-v0.161.0-alpha.10", "name": "0.161.0-alpha.10", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-10-01T09:29:47Z", "published_at": "2026-10-01T10:26:38Z", "body": "Release 0.161.0-alpha.10\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.159.0-alpha.12.1", "id": 401290664, "tag_name": "rust-v0.159.0-alpha.12.1", "name": "0.159.0-alpha.12.1", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:41:27Z", "published_at": "2026-10-01T19:37:00Z", "body": "Release 0.159.0-alpha.12.1\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.159.3", "id": 400492869, "tag_name": "rust-v0.159.3", "name": "0.159.3", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-30T21:46:22Z", "published_at": "2026-09-30T22:57:34Z", "body": "## New Features\n\n- Eligible local sessions signed in with ChatGPT can now show optional reminders to complete account security setup. (#49744)\n\n## Changelog\n\nFull Changelog: https://github.com/openai/codex/compare/rust-v0.159.2...rust-v0.159.3\n\n- #49744 [0.159] Backport account security setup reminders for 0.159.3 @andrewgu-oai\n\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.161.0-alpha.5", "id": 400391547, "tag_name": "rust-v0.161.0-alpha.5", "name": "0.161.0-alpha.5", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-30T18:44:23Z", "published_at": "2026-09-30T19:57:33Z", "body": "Release 0.161.0-alpha.5\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.161.0-alpha.4", "id": 399992984, "tag_name": "rust-v0.161.0-alpha.4", "name": "0.161.0-alpha.4", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-30T10:16:02Z", "published_at": "2026-09-30T11:49:10Z", "body": "Release 0.161.0-alpha.4\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.161.0-alpha.3", "id": 399667754, "tag_name": "rust-v0.161.0-alpha.3", "name": "0.161.0-alpha.3", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-30T01:29:21Z", "published_at": "2026-09-30T02:24:58Z", "body": "Release 0.161.0-alpha.3\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.160.0-alpha.6.2", "id": 400525499, "tag_name": "rust-v0.160.0-alpha.6.2", "name": "0.160.0-alpha.6.2", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-30T23:08:07Z", "published_at": "2026-10-01T00:08:35Z", "body": "Release 0.160.0-alpha.6.2\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.160.0-alpha.6.1", "id": 399637447, "tag_name": "rust-v0.160.0-alpha.6.1", "name": "0.160.0-alpha.6.1", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-30T00:07:20Z", "published_at": "2026-09-30T01:09:54Z", "body": "Release 0.160.0-alpha.6.1\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.159.2", "id": 399607589, "tag_name": "rust-v0.159.2", "name": "0.159.2", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-29T22:57:05Z", "published_at": "2026-09-29T23:57:16Z", "body": "## Bug Fixes\n\n- Suppressed console windows flashing on Windows when Codex launches background processes and sandboxed commands. (#49385)\n\n## Changelog\n\nFull Changelog: https://github.com/openai/codex/compare/rust-v0.159.1...rust-v0.159.2\n\n- #49385 [0.159] Backport Windows console suppression for 0.159.2 @andrewgu-oai\n\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.159.1", "id": 399499631, "tag_name": "rust-v0.159.1", "name": "0.159.1", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-29T19:24:44Z", "published_at": "2026-09-29T20:32:34Z", "body": "## New Features\n- Added GPT-6.1 Sol as the default model in the bundled catalog and Amazon Bedrock Mantle and Runtime catalogs. (#49323, #49342)\n\n## Changelog\n\nFull Changelog: https://github.com/openai/codex/compare/rust-v0.159.0...rust-v0.159.1\n\n- #49323 [0.159] Prepare 0.159.1 release backports @andrewgu-oai\n- #49342 [0.159] Backport GPT-6.1 Sol Bedrock catalogs @celia-oai\n\n\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.159.0", "id": 398926954, "tag_name": "rust-v0.159.0", "name": "0.159.0", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-29T06:52:06Z", "published_at": "2026-09-29T08:05:42Z", "body": "## New Features\n\n- Opt-in `instant_interrupt` lets new input steer Codex during model responses or long-running code-mode calls. (#48135, #48141)\n- New sessions get a compact welcome screen and consistent headers, with occasional tips during and after turns. (#48513, #48562, #48352)\n- The warnings viewer dismisses reviewed warnings when closed; press `k` to keep one for later. (#48205, #48206)\n- You can scroll the transcript while deciding whether to implement a plan. (#48805)\n- Native Mermaid rendering supports more flowchart edges, labels, and node groups. (#48814, #48895)\n- App-server clients can paginate thread history from a specific item. (#48151)\n\n## Bug Fixes\n\n- Windows launches avoid stray console windows for MCP servers, code-mode hosts, and piped commands; restrictive launchers can fall back to embedded mode. (#48138, #48238, #48483, #48491)\n- Copying transcript selections preserves Markdown tables, formatting, and significant whitespace. More terminals now copy automatically on selection. (#48548, #48549, #48469)\n- Blank sessions retain drafts when switching tasks, and threads can be archived and listed before their first turn. (#48628, #48828, #48199)\n- Local ChatGPT s"}]